==Matches==
All times listed are local time.

===Chile vs Switzerland===
The game didn't start well for the hosts when in the sixth minute [[Rolf Wüthrich]] scored with a long-range shot taking advantage of a bad throw by [[Misael Escuti|Escuti]]. As Chileans increased the pressure after the goal [[Karl Elsener (footballer)|Elsener]] had to make some fine saves. [[Carlos Contreras (footballer, born 1938)|Contreras]] and [[Leonel Sánchez|Sánchez]] also hit the woodwork. Just before halftime the score was level when Sánchez's shot was deflected by [[Fritz Morf|Morf]]. Six minutes into the second half [[Jaime Ramírez (footballer, born 1931)|Jaime Ramírez]] put Chile ahead and soon after [[Leonel Sánchez]] scored his second goal and secured the victory for Chile.<ref name="lingua">{{usurped|1=[https://web.archive.org/web/20170509015505/http://www.linguasport.com/futbol/internacional/mundial/1962_CHILE_FS.htm World Cup 1962: Game Details]}}</ref>

