===West Germany vs Italy===
{{see also|Germany–Italy football rivalry}}
This game saw not so many scoring chances for both sides. In the first half [[Uwe Seeler]] hit the bar, [[Albert Brülls]] and [[Omar Sívori]] also had their chances. In the second half the game became more physical and sometimes brutal but in the end defences overcame attacks and no goals were scored.<ref name="lingua" /><ref>[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-VZYSVVgU1k West Germany vs Italy on YouTube]</ref>

