===Italy vs Switzerland===
Almost as soon as the game started [[Bruno Mora]] opened the score after [[Karl Elsener (footballer)|Elsener]] deflected a crossshot by [[Ezio Pascutti|Pascutti]]. In the second half [[Giacomo Bulgarelli]], a new member of the team, scored two consecutive goals thus securing Italy's victory, though it was unable to prevent an early Italian elimination.<ref name="1962_final" />
